# Schema
- id: Primitive(Long) nullable=false
- name: Primitive(String) nullable=true
- age: Primitive(Integer) nullable=true
- height: Primitive(Double) nullable=true
- active: Primitive(Boolean) nullable=true
- birth_date: Primitive(Date) nullable=true
- created_at: Primitive(TimestampNtz) nullable=true
- updated_at: Primitive(Timestamp) nullable=true
- profile_data: Primitive(Binary) nullable=true
- salary: Primitive(Decimal(DecimalType { precision: 10, scale: 2 })) nullable=true

# Data
+----+----------+-----+--------+--------+------------+---------------------+----------------------+--------------+----------+
| id | name     | age | height | active | birth_date | created_at          | updated_at           | profile_data | salary   |
